# Custom HAProxy Detection Rules

These rules allow Wazuh to detect HAProxy backend availability events.

## Apache1 Down Detection

Rule ID:
100100

Level:
8

Detection:

Server agil_web_servers_ipvANY/apache_vm1 is DOWN

Action:

Generate an alert indicating Apache1 backend failure and failover to Apache2.


## Apache1 Recovery Detection

Rule ID:
100101

Level:
5

Detection:

Server agil_web_servers_ipvANY/apache_vm1 is UP

Action:

Generate an alert indicating Apache1 backend recovery.